@startuml SD-05 Scan Tag at Registration Desk
title SD-05 Scan Tag at Registration Desk

actor "Registration Staff" as Staff
participant "Registration Desk Node" as RegNode
participant "MQTT Broker" as MQTT
participant "Backend MQTT Handler" as Backend
participant "WebSocket Manager" as WS
participant "Asset Registration Page" as Page

Staff -> RegNode: Scan RFID tag
RegNode -> MQTT: Publish registration scan
MQTT -> Backend: Deliver scan message
Backend -> Backend: Validate registration node
Backend -> WS: Broadcast latest_scan
WS -> Page: Send scanned tag ID
Page -> Staff: Display tag ID in form

@enduml